Roles And Responsibilities Of The Local Complaints Committees:
The POSH Act assigns certain duties to the Local Complaints
Committees, which include:
i. Duty to inquire into complaints of sexual harassment received at an
organization and duty to prepare a detailed report;
ii. Duty to prepare an Annual Report in the prescribed format and timeframe, and
submit it to the employer and the District Officer;
